 Money is `Decimal` dollars, rounded to cents half-up (`shop/money.py`).
 Shipping is a flat $7.95, free once the merchandise subtotal reaches $75.
 Sales tax is 8.25% of merchandise only; shipping is not taxed.
+
+Orders (`shop/orders.py`) take the cart total at placement. Refunds are
+whole-cent `Decimal` amounts, may be partial, and can never push an order's
+refunded total past its total. Each refund takes an idempotency key scoped to
+its order: repeating a key with the same amount returns the original refund,
+and reusing a key with a different amount is an error.
